      {
        "id": 237133,
        "name": "WalkingTarget",
        "username": "WalkingTarget",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/walkingtarget/{size}/4833_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-04-26T16:15:09.414Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I wouldn’t group them with Minions, but they may group on their own.</p>\n<p>Like, if I had a unique Lieutenant (e.g. if I was using Firearm in a scene) I would probably give him his own turn. However, from the example on page 207, a group of three tanks could roll as a group.</p>\n<p>Edit - I mean, technically you could probably give each actor in a scene their own turn if you wanted. Grouping similar Minions/Lieutenants into a shared turn just makes things simpler to track.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-04-26T16:18:36.684Z",
        "reply_count": 1,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 38,
